{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_08_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_08","title":"汐斯塔狂想曲","storyCode":"OF-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"07525bad64b094e5a2ba6b44165ff8a4d12946d9039e5ff2ec27be2bd292ab29","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"在火山的另一邊，竟然有這樣一個洞窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這個洞窟原本應該是天然形成的，但是經過了大量人為黑曜石開採，內部已經變成一個很深的礦洞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"大家要做好準備，我們要在裡面走相當長的一段路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我的真正的目的地，就在這個洞窟的深處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"在研究室的時候我可是做夢也想不到，有一天我會在度假的時候深入火山深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"現在可以好好解釋一下了嗎，剛才在通信裡說的太籠統了，“這次火山爆發是可以阻止的”究竟是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......解說還是交給天火好了，你來解釋吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我和普羅旺斯之前在火山內部探索，然後跟艾雅法拉遠端交流得出的結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"提到原理，首先得從這裡源石蟲的生態說起......不，說不定稱呼它們為火山源石蟲或者熔岩源石蟲更為合適吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然外表與源石蟲幾乎一樣，但是它們以火山為巢穴，以這裡特別的黑曜石為食，在汐斯塔的火山內部築巢生根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"這些源石蟲居住的地方會非常接近火山的核心，也正好是這種混合了特殊成分的黑曜石大量產生的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"而這裡的人發現了這個特性，利用它們的蹤跡來發掘黑曜石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，我看過一些資料，有些地方的人，是透過生物的一些特性來尋找和發掘資源的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"人們總是能從和生物的聯繫中找到規律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"問題就在於，這座火山距離上次噴發已經是很久以前了，這裡的黑曜石是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"過度開採不僅對人們產生了影響，也破壞了源石蟲的居住環境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"於是它們的行為明顯開始躁動起來，估計大量不正常的火山內部活動都是它們開闢居住地的行為導致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"這種行為對源石蟲來說是有效擴張居住地的手段，但是對於汐斯塔市來說大概就是滅頂之災了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......“如果我們不懷抱著敬畏之心對待自然的饋贈，自然必然會賜以懲罰。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我們現在到底是要怎麼做呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們還能透過什麼手段，將火山堵上嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"換個說法，應該是，我們需要讓這裡的主人安穩下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"動作快，我們往深處走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"越來越熱了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"就在前面不遠了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"大家小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——————————！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"這聲音？聽起來.......好像很狂暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"當然了，這些蟲的智力程度並不足以讓他們以個體行為擴張居住地，那麼，必然有一隻特別的母蟲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"它才是這裡的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......要從那麼多源石蟲裡找到那什麼母蟲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？這可是一隻差點引發了火山噴發的熔岩源石蟲，它主宰著整座火山！肯定是一眼就能看出來的狠角色啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"被環境因素刺激變異的個體，可能性太多了，說不定可以瞬間融化一整支重裝小隊喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，這個讓整個岩壁都在隱隱作響的聲音，是一隻“源石蟲”發出的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"慌什麼，有我在這裡。就算這些熔岩源石蟲再怎麼變異也——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這是？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事......難道岩漿已經蔓延出來了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是那隻變異了的源石蟲！在洞穴的下方！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac3_volcanoboss"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石蟲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石蟲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"溫度在升高，這樣的熱量，作為一隻源石蟲而言，的確有些超出規格了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......那真的還能叫蟲？那不就是一整座移動的火山嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......畢竟沒有詳細的推演，與我推算的變異結果稍微有點差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我有點想念艾雅法拉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！它靠近了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石蟲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石蟲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————————！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"它、它能讓地面融化流動？不，不對，牆壁上地面上，佈滿了這些滾動著的像波浪一樣的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"離遠些，那些全部都是熔岩源石蟲，這是足夠引發火山運動的數量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼毫無疑問，目標就是這傢伙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只要讓它停止躁動，並且改變它行進的路線，應該就能有效的爭取到更多讓市民做好避難準備的時間了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著慢著！只憑我們幾個到底怎麼解決這座小型火山！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"打啊！還能怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣龐大的身體要是直接在這裡爆炸，真的不會直接引發火山噴發嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"那就麻煩它回到巢穴裡去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"總之還是得揍它嘛！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普羅旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["天火"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
